# The blanket *.png above would swallow the application icon, which the packaged
# builds need in the repo (Linux uses the .png directly).
!extras/*.png
# Likewise *.prg and *.s: those patterns are for the editor's own exports, but
# the viewer templates and their assembly sources ship with the app.
!data/*.prg
!extras/asm/*.s
